  "an4.251:0.3": "9. Dutiyavohārasuttaṃ ",
  "an4.251:1.1": "‘‘Cattārome, bhikkhave, ariyavohārā. ",
  "an4.251:1.2": "Katame cattāro? ",
  "an4.251:1.3": "Adiṭṭhe adiṭṭhavāditā, asute asutavāditā, amute amutavāditā, aviññāte aviññātavāditā – ",
  "an4.251:1.4": "ime kho, bhikkhave, cattāro ariyavohārā’’ti. ",
  "an4.251:1.5": "Navamaṃ. "
}
